    "## 1) One-Time Kaggle Setup + Full HaGRID Sample 30k Download\n",
    "\n",
    "This section does all of this:\n",
    "- Uses the Kaggle token file from `C:/Users/<you>/.kaggle/access_token.txt`.\n",
    "- Detects if the HaGRID Sample 30k dataset is already present in this repo.\n",
    "- Downloads the full HaGRID Sample 30k 384p dataset only if it is missing.\n",
    "- Stores dataset metadata in `dataset_registry.json` at repo root.\n",
    "- Verifies the dataset afterward by counting annotation files and images.\n",
    "\n",
    "Dataset reference: `innominate817/hagrid-sample-30k-384p`.\n",
    "\n",
    "Important:\n",
    "- This dataset already includes downscaled 384p images, so we can use all images for training, validation, and testing.\n",
    "- The later parsing/training cells work with the extracted dataset root."
   ]
